    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><ul><li>Site Location Plan (dated: 01/11/2024)</li><li>Existing and Proposed Block Plan (drawing ref: S.BP, dated: October 2024)</li><li>Proposed Ground, First Floor and Roof Plans (drawing ref: P101, dated: October 2024)</li><li>Planning Statement (received: 01/11/2024)</li></ul><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "a) Notwithstanding the cycle storage hereby approved in Proposed Block Plans (drawing ref: S.BP), prior to first use of the care home, details of all cycle storage including the design, quantum and location\r\nshall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\nAll cycle storage shall be designed in accordance with the London Cycle Design\r\nStandards.b) Te approved cycle storage shall be implemented and thereafter\r\nmaintained for the lifetime of the development.&nbsp;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>"
